        <mxCell id="b9QhIaXx8waYSKdlBub9-53" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95 NOp1Jf&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;As SaaS:&lt;/span&gt; It delivers ready-to-use, cloud-hosted enterprise applications—such as IT Service Management (ITSM), Human Resources (HR), and Customer Service Management (CSM)—accessible directly through a web browser on a subscription basis.&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloudconsultings.com/servicesnow-saas-or-paas/&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.servicenow.com/community/itsm-forum/is-snow-saas-or-paas-how/m-p/475027&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;As PaaS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt; It provides the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;Now Platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);&quot;&gt;, which includes development tools, low-code/no-code capabilities, databases, and runtime environments that let organizations build, test, and deploy custom applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.emergys.com/blog/servicenow-is-saas-paas/&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloudconsultings.com/servicesnow-saas-or-paas/&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
